FINAL ANSWER:
The first background command was stopped at its time limit. The cause was `git shortlog`: with no terminal attached, it waits for input on stdin and never finishes. I did not restart it, because the later `git blame` runs (with `</dev/null`) collected the same author data. The reviewer recommendation above is unchanged.

